<h1>Unit Conversion Calculator</h1>
<p>You can use this calculator to convert values to different units of measure, for example from feet to meters. First, choose the <i>Category</i> for your unit of measure.  Then input the value in the <i>Convert Value</i> field and select its units from the menu labeled <i>From</i>. Select the units to which you want to convert from the menu labeled <i>To</i>. Click the <i>Convert</i> button and the value, in new units, will appear. This calculator contains a wide range of units of measure used in the scientific and engineering communities.</p>
<form name="calculator" id="calculator" action="javascript:void(0)">

    
<div class="row">
      
<label for="category">Category:</label>
      <select name="category" id="category" onchange="rebuild()">
      <option value="acceleration">Acceleration</option>
      <option value="astronomical">Astronomical</option>
      <option value="angles">Angles</option>
      <option value="area">Area</option>
	  <option value="distance">Distance</option>
	  <option value="density">Density</option>
	  <option value="energy">Energy</option>
	  <option value="flowRate">Flow Rate (Vol)</option>		  
	  <option value="force">Force</option>
	  <option value="frequency">Frequency</option>
	  <option value="illuminance">Illuminance</option>
	  <option value="luminance">Luminance</option>
	  <option value="power">Power</option>
	  <option value="pressure">Pressure</option>
	  <option value="speed">Speed</option>
	  <option value="time">Time</option>
	  <option value="torque">Torque</option>
	  <option value="mass">Weight/Mass</option>
	  <option value="volume">Volume</option>

	  
      </select>
    
</div>
    
    
